usage: capture_vt13.py [-h] [--seconds SECONDS] [--output OUTPUT]
                       [--serial-number SERIAL_NUMBER] [--list]

Read DJI 2ca3:1020 interface 0 / bulk IN 0x81 as raw HEVC. Intended for
Linux/macOS with PyUSB and a system libusb-1.0 installation. Claims the video
interface and saves incoming bytes to a file or stdout. Keyframe control is
provided separately by examples/serial_monitor.py.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --seconds SECONDS     Capture duration; 0 means until Ctrl-C (default: 10).
  --output OUTPUT       Output file; use - for binary stdout.
  --serial-number SERIAL_NUMBER
                        Select one unit when several are connected.
  --list                Print descriptors only.
